\description{
Assigns each temporary habitat to a migration phase (typically
\emph{Wintering}, \emph{Stopover}, \emph{Breeding}) from the per-point Migration
Phase Index (MPI). The phase boundaries are \strong{density valleys anchored
to the extreme modes} of the MPI distribution; each point is cut into
a phase deterministically and each habitat then takes the \strong{majority}
phase of its points. No distributional model is fitted and no
prominence threshold is needed.
